<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-24754] Calcite. TPC-H query #17: possible require too much heap memory on client</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-24754</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In scale=1.0&#160; require a lot of heap memory on client.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In load test with 1 client and 3 servers with 5Gb heap invokes fullGC on client side having ~17Gb totally allocated for a single query&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
